<P STYLE="font: 9.5pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">Issued by Bank of Montreal</P>

<P STYLE="font: 9.5pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>25,000,000 Notes</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 9.5pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

<P STYLE="font: 9.5pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"></P>

